      "message": "Altanatively, how about calling it conditionally here?\n\n    if (get_state_pe(port) \u003d\u003d PE_SNK_READY) {\n        pd_set_input_current_limit(...);\n        charge_manager_set_ceil(...);\n    }\n\nThis seems to reflect the state diagram (8.3.3.3 in R3.1 V1.7) more closely.",
      "range": {
